# Keep the build context lean: only the workspace manifests + source are
# needed for `cargo build --locked`. Everything below is either rebuilt in the
# image, VCS metadata, or local tooling state that must never reach the layer.
target/
**/target/
.git/
.gitignore
refs/
.worktrees/
.venv/
__pycache__/
.tokensave/
.agents/
.claude/
.superpowers/
.github/
docs/
fuzz/
resources/
# Gallery demos are orchestration (compose files, TOMLs, SBOM fixtures) that the
# varved image never needs. Excluding them keeps editing a gallery from
# invalidating the COPY layer and forcing a full `cargo build --release` — a
# ~4-minute penalty per compose/corpus tweak, which the blast-radius corpus
# (~1 MB of .gz fixtures) triggered constantly.
gallery/
.DS_Store
skills-lock.json
